@sheet Data
@header | Product | Amount |
| A | 5 |
| B | 7 |
@header | Service | Hours | Rate |
| Audit | 2 | 40 |
| Support | 3 | 30 |

@sheet Summary
@header | Metric | Value |
| Product total | =Data!B2+Data!B3 |
| Service rate total | =Data!C5+Data!C6 |

@sheet Review
@header | Metric | Value |
| Carry | =Summary!B2+Summary!B3 |
| Hours | =Data!B5+Data!B6 |
